        "content": "Phần 1: 5 Bước Thực Hành Kiến Thức \n<div class=\"mb-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-blue-50/50 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-blue-100 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden\">\n<div class=\"absolute -right-10 -top-10 opacity-5 text-[150px] text-brand-blue\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-stairs\"></i></div>\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-brand-blue mb-8 inline-flex items-center bg-white px-5 py-2 rounded-full shadow-sm border border-blue-100 relative z-10\">\n<i class=\"fa-solid fa-stairs mr-2 text-brand-orange\"></i>5 Bước Thực Hành Kiến Thức\n                </h3>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row print:flex-row justify-between relative z-10\">\n<div class=\"hidden md:block absolute top-6 left-10 right-10 h-1.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-blue via-brand-orange to-green-500 rounded-full opacity-30 -z-10\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-center w-full md:w-1/5 relative mb-6 md:mb-0 px-2 group cursor-pointer\">\n<div class=\"w-14 h-14 mx-auto bg-brand-blue text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-2xl shadow-lg mb-4 border-4 border-white group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-700 transition-all duration-300\">\n                            1</div>\n<h4 class=\"font-bold text-[17px] text-brand-blue group-hover:text-blue-800 transition-colors\">\n                            Khởi động &amp; Định hướng</h4>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] text-slate-600 mt-1\">Nêu mục tiêu, dẫn dắt bài toán</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-center w-full md:w-1/5 relative mb-6 md:mb-0 px-2 group cursor-pointer\">\n<div class=\"w-14 h-14 mx-auto bg-brand-orange text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-2xl shadow-lg mb-4 border-4 border-white group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-orange-600 transition-all duration-300\">\n                            2</div>\n<h4 class=\"font-bold text-[17px] text-brand-orange group-hover:text-orange-700 transition-colors\">\n                            Tiếp cận kiến thức</h4>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] text-slate-600 mt-1\">Tìm trọng tâm, phân tích đề</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-center w-full md:w-1/5 relative mb-6 md:mb-0 px-2 group cursor-pointer\">\n<div class=\"w-14 h-14 mx-auto bg-brand-blue text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-2xl shadow-lg mb-4 border-4 border-white group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-700 transition-all duration-300\">\n                            3</div>\n<h4 class=\"font-bold text-[17px] text-brand-blue group-hover:text-blue-800 transition-colors\">\n                            Quan sát &amp; Phát hiện lỗi</h4>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] text-slate-600 mt-1\">Theo dõi quá trình làm bài</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-center w-full md:w-1/5 relative mb-6 md:mb-0 px-2 group cursor-pointer\">\n<div class=\"w-14 h-14 mx-auto bg-brand-orange text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-2xl shadow-lg mb-4 border-4 border-white group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-orange-600 transition-all duration-300\">\n                            4</div>\n<h4 class=\"font-bold text-[17px] text-brand-orange group-hover:text-orange-700 transition-colors\">\n                            Chữa lỗi</h4>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] text-slate-600 mt-1\">Lấy ví dụ, giải đáp thắc mắc</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-center w-full md:w-1/5 relative mb-6 md:mb-0 px-2 group cursor-pointer\">\n<div class=\"w-14 h-14 mx-auto bg-green-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-2xl shadow-lg mb-4 border-4 border-white group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-green-600 transition-all duration-300\">\n                            5</div>\n<h4 class=\"font-bold text-[17px] text-green-600 group-hover:text-green-700 transition-colors\">\n                            Chốt đáp án</h4>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] text-slate-600 mt-1\">Chữa chi tiết, Học sinh ghi chép</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n Phần 2: Quản lý lớp học \n<div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-blue-800 rounded-3xl p-8 text-white shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden\">\n<div class=\"absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 opacity-10 text-[120px]\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-users\"></i></div>\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-6 border-b border-blue-400/50 pb-3 flex items-center relative z-10\">\n<i class=\"fa-solid fa-users text-brand-orange mr-3 text-2xl\"></i>Quản lý Lớp học Hiệu quả\n                </h3>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 print:grid-cols-3 gap-6 relative z-10\">\n<div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/20 flex items-start gap-4 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:bg-white/20 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm\">\n<div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:shadow-md transition-all\">\n<i class=\"fa-solid fa-list-check text-2xl text-blue-600\"></i>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"font-bold text-white text-[17px] mb-1\">Giao nhiệm vụ rõ ràng</h4>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] text-blue-100 leading-relaxed\">Đảm bảo 100% Học sinh hiểu việc cần\n                                làm.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/20 flex items-start gap-4 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:bg-white/20 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm\">\n<div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-orange-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:shadow-md transition-all\">\n<i class=\"fa-solid fa-face-smile text-2xl text-orange-600\"></i>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"font-bold text-white text-[17px] mb-1\">Tạo không khí</h4>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] text-blue-100 leading-relaxed\">Kiểm soát nhịp độ, khuyến khích tương\n                                tác.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/20 flex items-start gap-4 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:bg-white/20 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm\">\n<div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:shadow-md transition-all\">\n<i class=\"fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-2xl text-green-600\"></i>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"font-bold text-white text-[17px] mb-1\">Xử lý tình huống</h4>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] text-blue-100 leading-relaxed\">Linh hoạt phản ứng với các sự cố.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
